=== layout: section

# How to Get the Recombination Frequency? (in Summary)

=== layout: one-panel

# Map Distance from Tetrad Counts

@body

- TT and NPD are counts; N is the total number of tetrads.
- The correction estimates crossovers for linked genes.

$$
D = \frac{\frac{1}{2}(TT + 6NPD)}{N} \times 100 \;\mathrm{cM}
$$

$$
D = \frac{\frac{1}{2}TT + 3NPD}{N} \times 100 \;\mathrm{cM}
$$

