=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- Tetrads retain all four products of one meiosis.
- PD, NPD, and TT identify different combinations of spore genotypes.
- Double crossovers affect the calculation of map distance.
- Ordered tetrads reveal segregation relative to a centromere.

